gal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{G}","name":"Parallel Lives","oracle_id":"84dc94b2-95fb-4d53-aaa2-191cb645639f","oracle_text":"If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2011-09-30","toughness":null,"type_line":"Enchantment"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{R}","name":"Shock","oracle_id":"a9d288b8-cdc1-4e55-a0c9-d6edfc95e65d","oracle_text":"Shock deals 2 damage to any target.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"banned","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"banned","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"banned","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"banned","vintage":"restricted"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}","name":"Sol Ring","oracle_id":"6ad8011d-3471-4369-9d68-b264cc027487","oracle_text":"{T}: Add {C}{C}.","power":null,"produced_mana":["C"],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"A triggered ability that triggers when a spell is cast from anywhere other than your hand, such as that of The Thirteenth Doctor, functions only on the battlefield, so it doesn't trigger when you cast that spell from a zone other than your hand.","oracle_id":"292aafef-8945-4827-90b2-1dd9764e517b","published_at":"2023-10-13","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"An instant or sorcery that counts how many spells you've cast from anywhere other than your hand, such as Surge of Brilliance, counts itself if it was cast from a zone other than your hand.","oracle_id":"292aafef-8945-4827-90b2-1dd9764e517b","published_at":"2023-10-13","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a spell or ability allows you to copy a spell on the stack but doesn't specify that the spell is cast, that spell wasn't cast and won't be counted by paradox abilities. However, if a spell or ability allows you to cast a copy of a spell, that spell will be counted for paradox abilities.","oracle_id":"292aafef-8945-4827-90b2-1dd9764e517b","published_at":"2023-10-13","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Paradox abilities count any spells cast from zones other than your hand. These are usually spells cast from exile, the graveyard, or the command zone. They also count spells cast from outside the game, such as spells cast with Wish or Garth One-Eye's ability.","oracle_id":"292aafef-8945-4827-90b2-1dd9764e517b","published_at":"2023-10-13","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you are unable to cast the card (there are no legal targets for the spell, for example), nothing happens when Memory Plunder resolves, and the card remains in its owner's graveyard.","oracle_id":"36b67014-0507-4976-ad52-a2a36676197d","published_at":"2008-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can't pay any alternative costs. On the other hand, if the card has additional costs (such as conspire), you may pay those.","oracle_id":"36b67014-0507-4976-ad52-a2a36676197d","published_at":"2008-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you want to cast the card, you cast it as part of the resolution of Memory Plunder. Timing restrictions based on the card's type are ignored if it's a sorcery. Other casting restrictions are not (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”).","oracle_id":"36b67014-0507-4976-ad52-a2a36676197d","published_at":"2008-05-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Everything that is specified by the effect creating the original token or tokens will also be true about the additional token or tokens created by Parallel Lives's replacement effect. For example, if an effect tells you to create a token \"tapped and attacking,\" the additional tokens will also be tapped and attacking.","oracle_id":"84dc94b2-95fb-4d53-aaa2-191cb645639f","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you control two Parallel Lives, then the number of tokens created is four times the original number. If you control three, then the number of tokens created is eight times the original number, and so on.","oracle_id":"84dc94b2-95fb-4d53-aaa2-191cb645639f","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an attacking creature loses haste, perhaps because Fervor leaves the battlefield after attackers have been declared, it won't be removed from combat.","oracle_id":"8e0cea9c-3110-4728-9378-76849e33bb90","published_at":"2012-07-01","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
